"}, {"title": "claude code release notes", "url": "https://claudelog.com/faqs/claude-code-release-notes"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.231"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.232"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.168"}, {"title": "Remote OpenClaw Blog", "url": "https://www.remoteopenclaw.com/blog/claude-code-changelog"}, {"title": "Claude Code v1.0.1 → v2.1.310: what changed", "url": "https://www.havoptic.com/r/claude-code/diff?from=1.0.1&to=latest"}], "tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01GhcXE3v7mPgwixWAzP8W4d"}, "The search results disagree on the latest version, and none of them is the official changelog itself. The newest version number I found is v2.1.310, but that comes from a third-party comparison page, so it should be checked.\n\n- **Newest figure found:** A Havoptic comparison page covers releases through v2.1.310, dated October 23, 2026 (390 releases shipped between v1.0.1 (May 22, 2025) and v2.1.310 (October 23, 2026).)\n- **Other recent figures:** releases.sh lists v2.1.294 as the latest, dated October 8, 2026 (total_releases: 359 latest_version: v2.1.294 latest_date: 2026-10-08). Another site, cc.bruniaux.com, shows v2.1.215 from July 19, 2026, and a Hidekazu Konishi article lists v2.1.307 as the latest it found in the GitHub repo.\n- **Official source:** Several results point to the official changelog at code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog, mirrored in CHANGELOG.md on the anthropics/claude-code GitHub repo. One community guide says the two official sources are the authoritative record of every build.\n- **Checking locally:** Running `claude --version` shows the installed build, and `claude update` installs the newest release.\n\nI'd treat v2.1.310 as the most likely latest version, but the official changelog is the place to confirm it, since these pages were captured at different times."], "searchCount": 1}, "type": "user", "uuid": "9877e795-4eb9-496e-bedb-358078544f4b"}
